</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c2ca29cf2b37c4898c6523798f8ac866dc31c04b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:13.254ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (H_{\mathbb {Z} },W_{\bullet },F^{\bullet })}"/></span> such that</p>

