</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/d1dda94f70180102ef07bcc82ab0a3d8adf28627" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:33.79ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle f:(H_{\mathbb {Z} },W_{\bullet },F^{\bullet })\to (H_{\mathbb {Z} }',W_{\bullet }',F'^{\bullet })}"/></span></p></blockquote><p id="mwUQ">such that</p><blockquote id="mwUg"><p id="mwUw"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt33" id="mwVA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"f(W_l) \\subset W&apos;_l"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle f(W_{l})\subset W'_{l}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>f</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>W</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>l</mi>
