  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f9add4085095b9b6d28d045fd9c92c2c09f549a7" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.678ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {C} }"/></span>-vector spaces has the property</p><blockquote id="mwVw"><p id="mwWA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt35" id="mwWQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"f_\\mathbb{C}(F^p) \\subset F&apos;^p"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle f_{\mathbb {C} }(F^{p})\subset F'^{p}}">
