</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/3d957374b9d872e2da172c1f7b594dcee84db955" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.171ex; width:9.18ex; height:3.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\text{Gr}}_{p+q}^{W_{\bullet }}H_{\mathbb {C} }}"/></span> is a weight <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt38" id="mwYg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(p+q) "}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle (p+q)}">
  <semantics>
