    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle (p+q)}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ed9d3b43fb0e3ee4b9bc392664cf5bd18981d96e" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:6.889ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (p+q)}"/></span> Hodge structure, and</p><blockquote id="mwYw"><p id="mwZA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt39" id="mwZQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\text{Gr}_p^{F^\\bullet} = \\frac{F^p}{F^{p+1}} "}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\text{Gr}}_{p}^{F^{\bullet }}={\frac {F^{p}}{F^{p+1}}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
