</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9769c58523b9b639866a2d48e657d9c26911143a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:5.082ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (p,q)}"/></span>-component of a weight <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt41" id="mwaA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"(p+q) "}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle (p+q)}">
