  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4bed937e3d6f0f644c07e285d350d8cf4b1fd864" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:7.151ex; height:2.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle W_{\bullet },F^{\bullet }}"/></span><sup about="#mwt54" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:0_1-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":":0"}}'><a href="#cite_note-:0-1" id="mwgg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwgw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwhA">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwhQ">]</span></span></a></sup> of the complex, meaning</p><blockquote id="mwhg"><p id="mwhw"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt55" id="mwiA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\begin{align}\nd(W_iA^\\bullet) &amp;\\subset W_iA^\\bullet \\\\\nd(F^iA^\\bullet) &amp;\\subset F^iA^\\bullet\n\\end{align}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}d(W_{i}A^{\bullet })&amp;\subset W_{i}A^{\bullet }\\d(F^{i}A^{\bullet })&amp;\subset F^{i}A^{\bullet }\end{aligned}}}">
