    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle (A^{\bullet },W_{\bullet },F^{\bullet })}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/94a5eb82aac9520de1f69f9c68ad77f97bf6b245" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:12.791ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (A^{\bullet },W_{\bullet },F^{\bullet })}"/></span>. Such a bi-filtered complex is called a <b id="mwkA">mixed Hodge complex</b>.<sup about="#mwt58" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-:0_1-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":":0"}}'><a href="#cite_note-:0-1" id="mwkQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwkg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwkw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwlA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class="reference nowrap" about="#mwt51" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwlQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"rp","href":"./Template:Rp"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"23"}},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Page / location: 23"><span typeof="mw:Entity">:</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>23<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="9" id="mwlg" aria-labelledby="Logarithmic_complex"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Logarithmic_complex">Logarithmic complex</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Mixed_Hodge_structure&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="Edit section: Logarithmic complex"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div><p id="mwlw">
Given a smooth variety <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt59" id="mwmA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"U \\subset X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle U\subset X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo>⊂<!-- ⊂ --></mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle U\subset X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c01cf5893c47ae0bfe4df06f73175c8d35bd68fa" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:6.861ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle U\subset X}"/></span> where <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt60" id="mwmQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"D = X - U"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle D=X-U}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>D</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
        <mi>U</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle D=X-U}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f4697d9cc82e6f599a01f6ffb19a162494cf6760" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.505ex; width:11.626ex; height:2.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle D=X-U}"/></span> is a normal crossing divisor (meaning all intersections of components are <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Complete_intersection" title="Complete intersection" id="mwmg">complete intersections</a>), there are filtrations on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Logarithmic_form" title="Logarithmic form" id="mwmw">logarithmic de Rham complex</a> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt61" id="mwnA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\Omega_X^\\bullet(\\log D)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \Omega _{X}^{\bullet }(\log D)}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msubsup>
          <mi mathvariant="normal">Ω<!-- Ω --></mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>X</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>∙<!-- ∙ --></mo>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>log</mi>
        <mo>⁡<!-- ⁡ --></mo>
        <mi>D</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \Omega _{X}^{\bullet }(\log D)}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ce97d3c4642d7a548a7200bb887fa62d55f9efd3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:10.403ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \Omega _{X}^{\bullet }(\log D)}"/></span> given by</p><blockquote id="mwnQ"><p id="mwng"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt62" id="mwnw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\begin{align}\nW_m\\Omega^i_X(\\log D) &amp;= \\begin{cases}\n\\Omega_X^i(\\log D) &amp; \\text{ if } i \\leq m \\\\\n\\Omega_X^{i-m}\\wedge \\Omega_X^m(\\log D) &amp; \\text{ if }0 \\leq m \\leq i \\\\\n0 &amp; \\text{ if } m &lt; 0\n\\end{cases} \\\\[6pt]\nF^p\\Omega^i_X(\\log D) &amp;= \\begin{cases}\n\\Omega_X^i(\\log D) &amp; \\text{ if } p \\leq i \\\\\n0 &amp; \\text{ otherwise}\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{align}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}W_{m}\Omega _{X}^{i}(\log D)&amp;={\begin{cases}\Omega _{X}^{i}(\log D)&amp;{\text{ if }}i\leq m\\\Omega _{X}^{i-m}\wedge \Omega _{X}^{m}(\log D)&amp;{\text{ if }}0\leq m\leq i\\0&amp;{\text{ if }}m&lt;0\end{cases}}\\[6pt]F^{p}\Omega _{X}^{i}(\log D)&amp;={\begin{cases}\Omega _{X}^{i}(\log D)&amp;{\text{ if }}p\leq i\\0&amp;{\text{ otherwise}}\end{cases}}\end{aligned}}}">
