  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ce97d3c4642d7a548a7200bb887fa62d55f9efd3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:10.403ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \Omega _{X}^{\bullet }(\log D)}"/></span>.</p>

<section data-mw-section-id="10" id="mwow" aria-labelledby="Smooth_compactifications"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading4"><h4 id="Smooth_compactifications">Smooth compactifications</h4><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Mixed_Hodge_structure&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="Edit section: Smooth compactifications"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div><p id="mwpA">
The above construction of the logarithmic complex extends to every smooth variety; and the mixed Hodge structure is isomorphic under any such compactificaiton. Note a <b id="mwpQ">smooth compactification of a smooth variety</b> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt65" id="mwpg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"U"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle U}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>U</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle U}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/458a728f53b9a0274f059cd695e067c430956025" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.783ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle U}"/></span> is defined as a smooth variety <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt66" id="mwpw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/68baa052181f707c662844a465bfeeb135e82bab" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.98ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle X}"/></span> and an embedding <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt67" id="mwqA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"U \\hookrightarrow X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle U\hookrightarrow X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">↪<!-- ↪ --></mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle U\hookrightarrow X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/3c272594f51752fb74ccce662b241b1212447df2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:7.669ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle U\hookrightarrow X}"/></span> such that <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt68" id="mwqQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"D = X - U"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle D=X-U}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>D</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
        <mi>U</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle D=X-U}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f4697d9cc82e6f599a01f6ffb19a162494cf6760" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.505ex; width:11.626ex; height:2.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle D=X-U}"/></span> is a normal crossing divisor. That is, given compactifications <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt69" id="mwqg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"U \\subset X, X&apos;"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle U\subset X,X'}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo>⊂<!-- ⊂ --></mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>X</mi>
          <mo>′</mo>
        </msup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
