  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/36733f856a0c337ab7a381dce057d7822505c221" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; margin-top: -0.326ex; width:29.161ex; height:3.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle i_{*}i^{!}\mathbb {Z} _{X}\to \mathbb {Z} _{X}\to Rj_{*}j^{*}\mathbb {Z} _{X}\xrightarrow {+} }"/></span> </p></blockquote> 

<p id="mw5Q">The purity isomorphism (coming from Verdier duality) identifies <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt97" id="mw5g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"i^!\\mathbb{Z}_X=i^*\\mathbb{Z}_X[-2](-1) "}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle i^{!}\mathbb {Z} _{X}=i^{*}\mathbb {Z} _{X}[-2](-1)}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mi>i</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>!</mo>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <msub>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>X</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>i</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>∗<!-- ∗ --></mo>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <msub>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>X</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
        <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
        <mn>2</mn>
        <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
        <mn>1</mn>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle i^{!}\mathbb {Z} _{X}=i^{*}\mathbb {Z} _{X}[-2](-1)}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/19520781fed9d92aa26ee68e1fabd544a87a5268" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:21.857ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle i^{!}\mathbb {Z} _{X}=i^{*}\mathbb {Z} _{X}[-2](-1)}"/></span>, whence the relevant terms of the exact triangle upon taking cohomology give us the exact sequence of MHS  </p>
<p id="mw5w">
<br id="mw6A"/></p>
<blockquote id="mw6Q"><p id="mw6g"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt98" id="mw6w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"0\\to H^1(X,\\mathbb{Z})\\to  H^1(U,\\mathbb{Z})\\to  H^0(Z,\\mathbb{Z})(-1)\\to  H^2(X,\\mathbb{Z})\\to 0 "}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle 0\to H^{1}(X,\mathbb {Z} )\to H^{1}(U,\mathbb {Z} )\to H^{0}(Z,\mathbb {Z} )(-1)\to H^{2}(X,\mathbb {Z} )\to 0}">
  <semantics>
