</section><section data-mw-section-id="14" id="mwAQE" aria-labelledby="Complement_of_a_smooth_projective_variety_by_a_closed_subvariety"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Complement_of_a_smooth_projective_variety_by_a_closed_subvariety">Complement of a smooth projective variety by a closed subvariety</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Mixed_Hodge_structure&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14" title="Edit section: Complement of a smooth projective variety by a closed subvariety"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div><p id="mwAQI">
Given a smooth projective variety <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt114" id="mwAQM" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X "}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X}">
