</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/eaf86791cccfab5ae59bdbcf8f65be697b1956dc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:12.16ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {P} ^{1}-\{0,\infty \}}"/></span>, hence its cohomology groups are isomorphic to</p><blockquote id="mwATQ"><p id="mwATU"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt140" id="mwATY" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\begin{align}\nH^0(\\mathbb{T})\\oplus H^1(\\mathbb{T}) &amp; \\cong \\mathbb{Z} \\oplus \\mathbb{Z}\n\\end{align}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}H^{0}(\mathbb {T} )\oplus H^{1}(\mathbb {T} )&amp;\cong \mathbb {Z} \oplus \mathbb {Z} \end{aligned}}}">
