</section><section data-mw-section-id="16" id="mwAUU" aria-labelledby="Quartic_K3_surface_minus_a_genus_3_curve"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Quartic_K3_surface_minus_a_genus_3_curve">Quartic K3 surface minus a genus 3 curve</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Mixed_Hodge_structure&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16" title="Edit section: Quartic K3 surface minus a genus 3 curve"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div><p id="mwAUY">
Given a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quartic_surface" title="Quartic surface" id="mwAUc">quartic K3 surface</a> <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt146" id="mwAUg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/68baa052181f707c662844a465bfeeb135e82bab" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.98ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle X}"/></span>, and a genus 3 curve <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt147" id="mwAUk" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"i:C \\hookrightarrow X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle i:C\hookrightarrow X}">
  <semantics>
